{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "28bdc88e-9e1f-8622-bc6c-6ec880397fda",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T11:27:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yesenia Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:24:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Luis. Yesenia Figueroa. I got a parking ticket during the snow ban and I want to contest it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:24:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Which ban was this, do you remember the date on the ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:24:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, let me find it. It's on the counter under the, um, the cabinet. Sorry, that's a milkshake to me. The blender. Under the blender. Okay, here. It's dated this past Saturday, the third."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:24:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's the reason you're disputing it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:25:01-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street was never plowed. Not once. And there was no sign posted either, no flashing light, nothing. I parked where I always park, and the next morning there's a ticket on the windshield."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:25:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So never plowed and never posted. Those are both worth writing down in the appeal. Do you have the ticket number there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:25:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. It's the one on the top right, the long one. Do you want me to read it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not just yet. You'll put it on the appeal form. Are you able to get to City Hall, or do you want it handled by mail?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:25:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail is better. I'm not trying to stand in another line. I was at the bank yesterday cashing a check and the line took forever. Forty minutes for one check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:25:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ouch. Banks on a Monday after a holiday week, that'll do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So, how long does the appeal take? Like once I send it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few weeks before you hear back. It depends how many are in the pile, and after a snow ban there's always a pile. The ticket clock may keep running in the meantime, so don't ignore any notice you get in the mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks. Okay. And do I owe anything while it's pending?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally an appeal puts the hold on it, but check the notice that comes back to you. If anything looks off, call us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where do I get the form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can mail one to you, or you can find it on the city website under parking tickets. Which would you rather?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail it, please. I'm not great at printing at home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. What's the mailing address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Actually, can I just give you my phone number and have somebody call? I'd rather not say the address on a cell phone in the store. I'm in a store right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that works. Go ahead with the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0182. I'll put a note in for someone to call you back today or tomorrow and get the mailing address for the form. Include your photos if you have any of the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. I took two of the street Sunday, still all snow. Good. I'll send those."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Luis."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Figueroa. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
